<title>USA: Sotheby's Holdings Inc Q1 shr loss shrinks.</title>
<headline>Sotheby's Holdings Inc Q1 shr loss shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.12     loss	 $0.15</p>
<p> Net loss		   6,783     loss	 8,157</p>
<p> Revs			54,082		   40,796</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  56,000		   56,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1997 auction sales were $207.26 million versus $155.04 million.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 operating loss $0.09 per share versus a loss of $0.15 per share. Q1 1997 operating results exclude non-recurring charges of about $2.5 million before taxes related primarily to legal and other professional fees associated with the Independent Review Committee, which looked at Sotheby's operations and other related activities.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
